warning[SC0402]: this may use a value after it was freed
   ╭─[ a_comma_inside_a_call_argument_orders_nothing_outside_it.c:6:13 ]
   │
 5 │     int *p = malloc(4);
   │              ────┬────  
   │                  ╰────── allocated here
 6 │     int x = g((free(p), 0), *p);
   │             ──────┬──┬─────────  
   │                   ╰────────────── freed here
   │                      │           
   │                      ╰─────────── used here, perhaps after the free
───╯
  = note: C17 6.5.2.2 p10 leaves a call indeterminately sequenced with the rest of its expression, and this check found nothing here that orders the free before this
  = note: this check belongs to safety level 1
  = note: this could not be proven; `--deny-unknown` makes it an error
  = help: put the free and this in separate statements, so that C orders one before the other
